{"ticker":{"symbol":"TJX","name":"TJX Companies, Inc. (The)","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":135.78,"change_pct":-0.0013239187996469948,"market_cap":149354463232.0,"pe":25.144444,"pb":14.038462,"dividend_yield":0.014140521431727794,"week52_low":122.78,"week52_high":170.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Apparel Retail","country":"United States","city":"Framingham","employees":377000,"website":"https://www.tjx.com","business_summary":"The TJX Companies, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as an off-price apparel and home fashions retailer worldwide. It operates through four segments: Marmaxx, HomeGoods, TJX Canada, and TJX International. The company provides family apparel comprising footwear; accessories, such as beauty and jewelry; home fashion products, including home basics, decorative accessories and giftware, as well as furniture, rugs, lighting, soft home, decorative accessories, tabletop, and cookware; pet and gourmet food; and other merchandise. It also offers home decor, furniture, and seasonal home merchandise. The company sells its products through stores and e-commerce sites. The TJX Companies, Inc. was incorporated in 1962 and is headquartered in Framingham, Massachusetts.","business_summary_ko":"TJX Companies, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 전 세계적으로 할인 의류 및 가정 패션 소매업체로 운영되고 있습니다. Marmaxx, HomeGoods, TJX Canada 및 TJX International의 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 신발로 구성된 가족 의류를 제공합니다. 미용 및 보석과 같은 액세서리; 가구, 양탄자, 조명, 소프트 홈, 장식용 액세서리, 테이블 상판 및 조리기구뿐만 아니라 홈 기본 제품, 장식용 액세서리 및 선물 용품을 포함한 홈 패션 제품; 애완동물 및 고급 식품; 및 기타 상품. 또한 가정 장식, 가구, 계절별 가정용품도 제공합니다. 회사는 상점과 전자상거래 사이트를 통해 제품을 판매합니다. TJX Companies, Inc.는 1962년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠주 프레이밍햄에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2027","rev":63995908990.0,"rev_lo":63614100000.0,"rev_hi":64528275860.0,"rev_g":0.06,"n":21,"eps":5.23208,"eps_lo":5.17,"eps_hi":5.30445,"eps_g":0.10609999},{"period":"2028","rev":67954359300.0,"rev_lo":66628000000.0,"rev_hi":69290000000.0,"rev_g":0.0619,"n":21,"eps":5.